        <activityName xml:lang="en">Corrugated board base paper, semichemical fluting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Corrugated board base paper, semichemical fluting, at plant
na;
UUID: 70516c19-7092-3375-88b4-ec660ba8fc8b
This module includes the European production of semichemical fluting paper in an integrated mill - including transports to paper mill, wood handling, chemical pulping, paper production, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Average data from European producers, collected from FEFCO and checked by technical specialists
Location:  Average data from European producers, collected from FEFCO and checked by technical specialists
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: represented European production in 2005: 3'955 kt (FEFCO report)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Additional air emissions estimated based on respective industrial heating modules of this study
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_70516c19-7092-3375-88b4-ec660ba8fc8b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
